---
source: crates/test-framework/src/snapshot/mod.rs
description: "Query: tpch_q7"
---
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Federated                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |  Sort: shipping.supp_nation ASC NULLS LAST, shipping.cust_nation ASC NULLS LAST, shipping.l_year ASC NULLS LAST                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |   Projection: shipping.supp_nation, shipping.cust_nation, shipping.l_year, sum(shipping.volume) AS revenue                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |
|               |     Aggregate: groupBy=[[shipping.supp_nation, shipping.cust_nation, shipping.l_year]], aggr=[[sum(shipping.volume)]]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |       SubqueryAlias: shipping                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |         Projection: n1.n_name AS supp_nation, n2.n_name AS cust_nation, date_part(Utf8("YEAR"), pg.public.lineitem.l_shipdate) AS l_year, pg.public.lineitem.l_extendedprice * (Int64(1) - pg.public.lineitem.l_discount) AS volume                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        |
|               |           Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.customer.c_nationkey = n2.n_nationkey AND (n1.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE") AND n2.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") OR n1.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") AND n2.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE"))                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |             Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.supplier.s_nationkey = n1.n_nationkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |               Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.customer.c_custkey = pg.public.orders.o_custkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               |
|               |                 Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.orders.o_orderkey = pg.public.lineitem.l_orderkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                   Inner Join:  Filter: pg.public.supplier.s_suppkey = pg.public.lineitem.l_suppkey                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |                     TableScan: pg.public.supplier projection=[s_suppkey, s_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                      |
|               |                     TableScan: pg.public.lineitem projection=[l_orderkey, l_suppkey, l_extendedprice, l_discount, l_shipdate], full_filters=[pg.public.lineitem.l_shipdate BETWEEN CAST(Utf8("1995-01-01") AS Date32) AND CAST(Utf8("1996-12-31") AS Date32)]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |                   TableScan: pg.public.orders projection=[o_orderkey, o_custkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
|               |                 TableScan: pg.public.customer projection=[c_custkey, c_nationkey]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |               Filter: n1.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE") OR n1.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                 SubqueryAlias: n1                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |                   TableScan: pg.public.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name], full_filters=[pg.public.nation.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE") OR pg.public.nation.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                       |
|               |             Filter: n2.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") OR n2.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE")                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                              |
|               |               SubqueryAlias: n2                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |                 TableScan: pg.public.nation projection=[n_nationkey, n_name], full_filters=[pg.public.nation.n_name = Utf8("GERMANY") OR pg.public.nation.n_name = Utf8("FRANCE")]                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
| physical_plan | SchemaCastScanExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |   CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |     BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |       VirtualExecutionPlan name=postgres compute_context=host=Tcp("benchmarking-postgres-rw.dataplatform.svc.cluster.local"),port=5432,db=tpch_sf1,user=postgres, base_sql=SELECT "shipping"."supp_nation", "shipping"."cust_nation", "shipping"."l_year", sum("shipping"."volume") AS "revenue" FROM (SELECT "n1"."n_name" AS "supp_nation", "n2"."n_name" AS "cust_nation", date_part('YEAR', "lineitem"."l_shipdate") AS "l_year", ("lineitem"."l_extendedprice" * (1 - "lineitem"."l_discount")) AS "volume" FROM "public"."supplier" INNER JOIN "public"."lineitem" ON (("supplier"."s_suppkey" = "lineitem"."l_suppkey") AND ("lineitem"."l_shipdate" BETWEEN CAST('1995-01-01' AS DATE) AND CAST('1996-12-31' AS DATE))) INNER JOIN "public"."orders" ON ("orders"."o_orderkey" = "lineitem"."l_orderkey") INNER JOIN "public"."customer" ON ("customer"."c_custkey" = "orders"."o_custkey") INNER JOIN "public"."nation" AS "n1" ON (("supplier"."s_nationkey" = "n1"."n_nationkey") AND (("n1"."n_name" = 'FRANCE') OR ("n1"."n_name" = 'GERMANY'))) INNER JOIN "public"."nation" AS "n2" ON ((("customer"."c_nationkey" = "n2"."n_nationkey") AND ((("n1"."n_name" = 'FRANCE') AND ("n2"."n_name" = 'GERMANY')) OR (("n1"."n_name" = 'GERMANY') AND ("n2"."n_name" = 'FRANCE')))) AND (("n2"."n_name" = 'GERMANY') OR ("n2"."n_name" = 'FRANCE')))) AS "shipping" GROUP BY "shipping"."supp_nation", "shipping"."cust_nation", "shipping"."l_year" ORDER BY "shipping"."supp_nation" ASC NULLS LAST, "shipping"."cust_nation" ASC NULLS LAST, "shipping"."l_year" ASC NULLS LAST |
|               |                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            |
+---------------+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
